---
const chapters = ['Scryr', 'Old maps', 'Spellbook', 'Metrics', 'CI / CD', 'index.scry'];
---

<main class="spell-scroll" data-scroll-story aria-label="The Scryr story">
  <nav class="chapter-rail" aria-label="Story chapters">
    {chapters.map((chapter, index) => <a href={`#chapter-${index + 1}`} data-chapter-link={index} aria-label={`Chapter ${index + 1}: ${chapter}`}><i></i><span>{chapter}</span></a>)}
  </nav>

  <section id="chapter-1" class="scene hero" data-scene="0" aria-labelledby="story-title">
    <div class="stars" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><b>✦</b><b>◇</b><b>⌁</b></div>
    <div class="copy hero-copy"><img src="/favicon.svg" alt="Scryr" width="196" height="196"/><p class="eyebrow">The architecture grimoire</p><h1 id="story-title">Scryr</h1><p class="lede">Actionable architecture.</p></div>
    <a class="scroll-cue" href="#chapter-2">Turn the page <b>↓</b></a>
  </section>

  <section id="chapter-2" class="scene old-world" data-scene="1" aria-labelledby="diagram-title">
    <div class="grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="copy centered"><p class="eyebrow">01 / The old world</p><h2 id="diagram-title">AI agents have transformed software.</h2><p class="lede">Why do software diagrams still look like this?</p>
      <figure class="mermaid-mess" aria-label="An overcrowded Mermaid diagram"><figcaption><span>● ● ●</span> architecture-final-v7-updated.mmd</figcaption>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 880 390" role="img" aria-label="A tangled diagram with crossing connections">
          <g class="mess-lines"><path d="M132 78C330 28 520 360 748 284"/><path d="M138 86C308 325 578 34 742 282"/><path d="M135 82L442 196 742 96"/><path d="M273 288C412 24 604 348 744 92"/><path d="M281 284L442 196 603 286"/><path d="M276 286C312 128 655 170 744 96"/><path d="M132 82C284 210 600 206 746 284"/><path d="M442 196C514 76 658 72 744 96"/><path d="M442 196C518 314 604 312 746 284"/></g>
          <g class="nodes"><rect x="58" y="46" width="150" height="72"/><text x="133" y="88">Frontend??</text><rect x="205" y="248" width="152" height="72"/><text x="281" y="290">API v2</text><rect x="365" y="158" width="154" height="74"/><text x="442" y="201">Service</text><rect x="527" y="249" width="152" height="72"/><text x="603" y="291">Database</text><rect x="670" y="55" width="150" height="72"/><text x="745" y="97">Queue?</text><rect x="670" y="247" width="150" height="72"/><text x="745" y="289">Everything</text></g><text class="note" x="410" y="360">who owns this?</text>
        </svg><pre><code>graph TD
  A --&gt; B &amp; C &amp; D
  B -- maybe? --&gt; F
  C --&gt; A --&gt; E --&gt; C</code></pre>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="chapter-3" class="scene spellbook" data-scene="2" aria-labelledby="spellbook-title"><div class="spellbook-image" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flare" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / A living map</p><h2 id="spellbook-title">Make your codebase<br/><em>a spellbook.</em></h2><p class="lede">A system you can read, explore, and interrogate—not a picture that starts going stale the moment it is exported.</p><a class="text-link" href="/getting-started/">Open the grimoire ↗</a></div></section>

  <section id="chapter-4" class="scene evidence metrics" data-scene="3" aria-labelledby="metrics-title"><div class="copy split"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Runtime evidence</p><h2 id="metrics-title">Examine what is happening <em>now.</em></h2><p class="lede">Bring metrics into the architecture. Trace latency, traffic, and errors back to the service that produced them.</p></div>
    <div class="artifact metric-window" aria-label="Live service metrics"><header><span>northwind-api</span><b class="live">● LIVE</b></header><div class="metric-total"><small>Requests / minute</small><strong>24,891</strong><span>+12.4%</span></div><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 560 210" role="img" aria-label="Request rate trending upward"><defs><linearGradient id="fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#69e3ff" stop-opacity=".42"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#69e3ff" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs><g class="chart-grid"><path d="M0 35H560M0 87H560M0 139H560M0 191H560"/></g><path class="area" d="M0 172C38 158 49 165 84 144S146 169 179 127 236 144 271 107 335 121 369 83 421 108 457 62 518 81 560 24V210H0Z"/><path class="line" d="M0 172C38 158 49 165 84 144S146 169 179 127 236 144 271 107 335 121 369 83 421 108 457 62 518 81 560 24"/><circle cx="560" cy="24" r="6"/></svg><div class="metric-row"><span>p95 latency <b>184ms</b></span><span>error rate <b>0.08%</b></span></div></div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="chapter-5" class="scene evidence cicd" data-scene="4" aria-labelledby="cicd-title"><div class="copy split reverse"><div class="artifact pipeline-window" aria-label="A failed deployment pipeline"><header><span>deploy-production.yml</span><b class="failed">FAILED</b></header><div class="commit"><i>⌁</i><span><strong>feat: route checkout through payments-v2</strong><small>7f3a1c8 · 4 minutes ago</small></span></div><div class="pipeline"><div class="step ok"><i>✓</i><span>Build<small>42s</small></span></div><b></b><div class="step ok"><i>✓</i><span>Test<small>1m 08s</small></span></div><b class="broken"></b><div class="step bad"><i>×</i><span>Deploy<small>exit 1</small></span></div></div><div class="failure-card"><b>×</b><span><strong>stripe-integration</strong><small>Health check failed after revision 38</small></span><code>503</code></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">04 / Delivery evidence</p><h2 id="cicd-title">Examine what build <em>broke.</em></h2><p class="lede">Connect CI/CD history to the map. See the commit, pipeline, and affected service in one place.</p></div></div></section>

  <section id="chapter-6" class="scene code-scene" data-scene="5" aria-labelledby="code-title"><div class="runes" aria-hidden="true">λ　◇　{ }　✦　→　⌁</div><div class="copy centered"><p class="eyebrow">05 / Source of truth</p><h2 id="code-title">Generate it from a typed Python file.</h2><p class="filename">◆ index.scry</p><div class="code-book"><div class="gutter" aria-hidden="true">1<br/>2<br/>3<br/>4<br/>5<br/>6<br/>7<br/>8<br/>9<br/>10<br/>11</div><pre><code><span class="kw">from</span> scryr <span class="kw">import</span> Diagram, Manifest, Info, Metrics, CICD

api = Manifest(
    name=<span class="str">"northwind-api"</span>,
    info=Info(
        owner_team=<span class="str">"Commerce"</span>,
        language=ProgrammingLanguage.python,
    ),
    metrics=Metrics(provider=MetricsProvider.prometheus),
    cicd=CICD(provider=CICDProvider.github_actions),
)

Diagram(name=<span class="str">"Northwind"</span>, manifests=[api])</code></pre></div><div class="actions"><a href="/getting-started/">Create your spellbook →</a><a href="/llm-prompt/">Generate with an agent</a></div></div><img class="closing" src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="64" height="64"/></section>
</main>

<script>
  const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-scroll-story]');
  const scenes = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-scene]')];
  const links = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-chapter-link]')];
  let ticking = false;
  const paint = () => { const middle = innerHeight / 2; let active=0, near=Infinity; scenes.forEach((scene,index)=>{const box=scene.getBoundingClientRect();const p=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(middle-box.top-box.height/2)/innerHeight));scene.style.setProperty('--p',String(p));const d=Math.abs(box.top+box.height/2-middle);if(d<near){near=d;active=index}});root?.style.setProperty('--active',String(active));links.forEach((link,index)=>link.toggleAttribute('data-active',index===active));ticking=false };
  const update=()=>{if(!ticking){requestAnimationFrame(paint);ticking=true}};paint();addEventListener('scroll',update,{passive:true});addEventListener('resize',update);
</script>

<style>
  :global(.content-panel),:global(.main-frame){padding:0!important}:global(.sl-container){max-width:none!important}:global(header.header){background:rgba(7,4,13,.68);backdrop-filter:blur(18px)}
  .spell-scroll{width:100vw;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);margin-top:calc(var(--sl-nav-height)*-1);color:var(--story-ink);background:var(--story-void);overflow:clip}.scene{--p:0;position:relative;min-height:100svh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:clamp(6rem,9vw,9rem) clamp(1.25rem,7vw,7rem);isolation:isolate;perspective:1200px}.scene:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:auto 8vw 0;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#d7a85355,transparent)}.copy{width:min(100%,76rem);z-index:2;transform:translateY(calc(var(--p)*-2rem));opacity:calc(1 - max(var(--p),calc(var(--p)*-1))*.42)}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 1.15rem;color:var(--story-gold);letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.78rem}.scene h2{max-width:15ch;margin:0;color:var(--story-ink);font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6.2vw,5.8rem);line-height:.98;text-wrap:balance}.scene h2 em{color:var(--story-gold);font-style:normal;text-shadow:0 0 2.5rem #e7c77c44}.lede{max-width:43rem;margin:1.4rem 0 0;color:var(--story-muted);font-size:clamp(1rem,1.6vw,1.25rem);line-height:1.7}.centered{text-align:center;display:grid;justify-items:center}.centered h2{max-width:19ch}
  .chapter-rail{position:fixed;right:clamp(.7rem,2vw,2rem);top:50%;z-index:20;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;transform:translateY(-50%)}.chapter-rail a{display:flex;flex-direction:row-reverse;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;color:var(--story-muted);text-decoration:none}.chapter-rail i{width:.45rem;aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid currentColor;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:.3s}.chapter-rail span{max-width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;white-space:nowrap;font-size:.68rem;text-transform:uppercase;transition:.3s}.chapter-rail a:hover span,.chapter-rail a:focus-visible span{max-width:7rem;opacity:1}.chapter-rail a[data-active]{color:var(--story-gold)}.chapter-rail a[data-active] i{background:currentColor;box-shadow:0 0 1rem currentColor;transform:rotate(225deg) scale(1.4)}
  .hero{text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 44%,#9a4bff3d,transparent 24rem),radial-gradient(circle at 50% 48%,#5ce5ff14,transparent 42rem)}.hero-copy{display:grid;justify-items:center}.hero-copy img{width:clamp(8rem,18vw,12rem);height:auto;margin-bottom:1.4rem;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 2.5rem #a759ff99);animation:float 4s ease-in-out infinite}.hero h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(4.5rem,14vw,11rem);line-height:.78;text-shadow:0 0 4rem #a85cff55}.hero .lede{font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.4vw,1.8rem)}.stars{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;background-image:radial-gradient(circle,#fff 0 1px,transparent 1.5px),radial-gradient(circle,#bc80ff 0 1px,transparent 1.5px);background-size:83px 83px,131px 131px;opacity:.55;transform:translateY(calc(var(--p)*7rem))}.orbit{position:absolute;width:min(72vw,48rem);aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #d7a85344;border-radius:50%;transform:rotate(calc(var(--p)*80deg));animation:spin 30s linear infinite}.orbit i{position:absolute;inset:15%;border:1px dashed #a85cff55;border-radius:50%}.orbit b{position:absolute;color:var(--story-gold);text-shadow:0 0 1rem currentColor}.orbit b:nth-of-type(1){top:4%;left:50%}.orbit b:nth-of-type(2){right:3%;top:48%}.orbit b:nth-of-type(3){bottom:8%;left:20%}.scroll-cue{position:absolute;bottom:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:var(--story-muted)!important;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;animation:bob 2s ease-in-out infinite}.scroll-cue b{color:var(--story-gold);font-size:1.1rem}
  .old-world{background:radial-gradient(circle at 75% 30%,#ff486917,transparent 30rem),#09070f}.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(#ffffff0a 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#ffffff0a 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:44px 44px;opacity:.4;mask-image:linear-gradient(transparent,#000)}.mermaid-mess{position:relative;width:min(100%,62rem);margin:3rem 0 0;border:1px solid #ffffff1f;background:#0e0d12e8;box-shadow:0 2.5rem 8rem #0008;transform:rotateX(calc(var(--p)*-4deg)) rotateZ(calc(var(--p)*1.5deg))}.mermaid-mess figcaption{padding:.8rem 1rem;color:#8f8997;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff18;font-size:.72rem;text-align:left}.mermaid-mess figcaption span{color:#ff607c;margin-right:.8rem}.mermaid-mess svg{display:block;width:100%}.mess-lines{fill:none;stroke:#ff607c88;stroke-width:2.5;stroke-dasharray:7 5;stroke-dashoffset:calc(var(--p)*80)}.nodes rect{fill:#1c1822;stroke:#8e8299;stroke-width:2}.nodes text{fill:#e5dce9;font:16px 'Source Code Pro';text-anchor:middle}.note{fill:#ff607c;font:italic 18px 'Source Code Pro'}.mermaid-mess pre{position:absolute;left:1rem;bottom:1rem;margin:0;padding:.7rem;color:#817887;background:#050407cc;font-size:.58rem;text-align:left}
  .spellbook{justify-items:start;min-height:115svh}.spellbook-image{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-2;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#07040df5,#07040dae 38%,#07040d0d 72%),linear-gradient(0deg,#07040d,transparent 22% 80%,#07040d),url('/assets/scryr-spellbook-map.png') center/cover;transform:scale(calc(1.08 + max(var(--p),calc(var(--p)*-1))*.06))}.flare{position:absolute;left:57%;top:49%;width:2px;height:2px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 2rem 1rem #fff,0 0 7rem 3rem #a85cff,0 0 16rem 7rem #69e3ff44}.spellbook .copy{margin-left:4vw}.spellbook h2{max-width:12ch}.spellbook .lede{max-width:33rem}.text-link{display:inline-block;margin-top:2rem;color:var(--story-gold)!important;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #e7c77c66;padding-bottom:.3rem}
  .evidence{background:radial-gradient(circle at 70% 45%,#69e3ff1a,transparent 30rem),#080711}.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(28rem,1.2fr);align-items:center;gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,7rem)}.artifact{padding:clamp(1rem,2.5vw,2rem);border:1px solid #69e3ff42;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#121d2aed,#0a0814f5);box-shadow:0 2.5rem 8rem #0008,0 0 4rem #69e3ff14;clip-path:polygon(0 0,calc(100% - 1.3rem) 0,100% 1.3rem,100% 100%,1.3rem 100%,0 calc(100% - 1.3rem));transform:translateX(calc(var(--p)*4rem)) rotateY(calc(var(--p)*-7deg))}.artifact header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.82rem}.live{color:#5ee5b6;font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.14em}.metric-total{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;margin-top:2rem}.metric-total small{grid-column:1/-1;color:#8191a5}.metric-total strong{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.5rem);line-height:1}.metric-total span{color:#5ee5b6}.chart{width:100%;margin-top:1.4rem;overflow:visible}.chart-grid{stroke:#ffffff14}.area{fill:url(#fill)}.line{fill:none;stroke:#69e3ff;stroke-width:4;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 7px #69e3ffaa);stroke-dasharray:800;stroke-dashoffset:calc(max(var(--p),0)*550)}.chart circle{fill:#fff;stroke:#69e3ff;stroke-width:4}.metric-row{display:flex;gap:1rem}.metric-row span{flex:1;padding:.8rem;color:#8998aa;background:#ffffff09;font-size:.72rem}.metric-row b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:1rem;margin-top:.2rem}
  .cicd{background:radial-gradient(circle at 25% 50%,#ff526f1a,transparent 30rem),#0b070e}.reverse{grid-template-columns:minmax(28rem,1.2fr) minmax(0,.8fr)}.pipeline-window{border-color:#ff5c7a40;transform:translateX(calc(var(--p)*-4rem)) rotateY(calc(var(--p)*7deg))}.failed{color:#ff607c;border:1px solid;padding:.2rem .5rem;font-size:.64rem}.commit{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;margin:1.5rem 0;padding:1rem;background:#ffffff09}.commit i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.3rem;aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #a85cff66;border-radius:50%}.commit strong,.commit small{display:block}.commit strong{font-size:.78rem}.commit small{color:#817787;font-size:.66rem;margin-top:.25rem}.pipeline{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;padding:1.4rem 0}.step{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:.4rem;min-width:4.8rem}.step i{display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.5rem;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:50%;font-style:normal}.step span{font-size:.7rem;text-align:center}.step small{display:block;color:#776f7e}.step.ok i{color:#5ee5b6;border:1px solid}.step.bad i{color:#ff607c;border:1px solid;box-shadow:0 0 1.4rem #ff607c44;animation:pulse 1.6s infinite}.pipeline>b{width:clamp(2rem,6vw,6rem);height:1px;margin-top:1.25rem;background:#5ee5b6}.pipeline>b.broken{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5ee5b6 42%,transparent 42% 58%,#ff607c 58%)}.failure-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid #ff607c33;background:#ff607c0f}.failure-card>b{color:#ff607c;font-size:1.4rem}.failure-card span{flex:1}.failure-card strong,.failure-card small{display:block}.failure-card small{color:#a28e96;font-size:.66rem}.failure-card code{color:#ff8098}
  .code-scene{text-align:center;min-height:112svh;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%,#a85cff26,transparent 32rem),linear-gradient(#090611,#050308)}.filename{color:var(--story-gold);font-size:.82rem;margin:1.5rem 0 .8rem}.code-book{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.8rem 1fr;width:min(100%,52rem);text-align:left;border:1px solid #d7a85347;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#150c1ff5,#08060dfa);box-shadow:0 2.8rem 8rem #0009;transform:translateY(calc(var(--p)*-2rem)) rotateX(calc(var(--p)*5deg));overflow:hidden}.gutter{padding:1.2rem .7rem;color:#574b62;background:#0003;border-right:1px solid #ffffff0f;font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.68}.code-book pre{margin:0;padding:1.2rem;overflow:auto;background:transparent;color:#d6cddd;font-size:clamp(.67rem,1.2vw,.88rem);line-height:1.68}.code-book code{font:inherit}.kw{color:#c285ff}.str{color:#e7c77c}.actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:2rem}.actions a{padding:.85rem 1.15rem;text-decoration:none!important;font-size:.82rem;border:1px solid #e7c77c4d;color:var(--story-muted)!important}.actions a:first-child{color:#fff!important;border-color:#a85cff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7130bd,#a85cff);box-shadow:0 1rem 3rem #7130bd4d}.runes{position:absolute;color:#a85cff2b;font:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem) 'Cinzel Decorative';word-spacing:6vw;transform:translateY(calc(var(--p)*-8rem)) rotate(calc(var(--p)*5deg))}.closing{position:absolute;bottom:1rem;width:3rem;opacity:.35;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 1rem #a85cff)}
  @keyframes float{50%{transform:translateY(-.5rem) scale(1.035)}}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes bob{50%{transform:translateY(.5rem)}}@keyframes pulse{50%{box-shadow:0 0 2.4rem #ff607c88}}
  @media(max-width:56rem){.chapter-rail{display:none}.scene{min-height:auto;padding-block:7rem}.split,.reverse{grid-template-columns:1fr}.reverse>div:last-child{order:-1}.spellbook{min-height:100svh;align-content:end}.spellbook-image{background:linear-gradient(0deg,#07040dfc,#07040d44 62%,#07040d14),url('/assets/scryr-spellbook-map.png') 64% center/cover}.spellbook .copy{margin:0}.artifact{margin-top:1rem}.mermaid-mess pre{display:none}}
  @media(max-width:34rem){.scene{padding-inline:1.1rem}.scene h2{font-size:2.6rem}.orbit{width:34rem}.mermaid-mess{width:calc(100% + 1rem)}.artifact{padding:1rem}.pipeline>b{width:1.5rem}.step{min-width:3.8rem}.code-book{grid-template-columns:2.1rem 1fr}.code-book pre,.gutter{font-size:.59rem;padding:.8rem .45rem}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hero-copy img,.orbit,.scroll-cue,.step.bad i{animation:none}.copy,.stars,.orbit,.spellbook-image,.artifact,.code-book,.runes{transform:none!important}.copy{opacity:1!important}.line{stroke-dashoffset:0!important}}
</style>
